WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.217
"There's going to be a carriage race!" Tom said.

2
00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:13.059
"Kings will come from other kingdoms.

3
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.777
They will see whose royal carriage is fastest.

4
00:00:16.778 --> 00:00:19.322
It will be so exciting!"

5
00:00:19.323 --> 00:00:21.715
Cat licked a paw.

6
00:00:21.716 --> 00:00:25.264
"It sounds like a royal mess," she said.

7
00:00:25.265 --> 00:00:29.360
"One king will win. The others will lose.

8
00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:32.854
And kings do not like losing!"

9
00:00:32.855 --> 00:00:37.466
"The royal wizards will put spells on the carriages," said Tom.

10
00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:41.267
"The best spell will win the race.

11
00:00:41.268 --> 00:00:45.089
I need a good spell for the king's carriage."

12
00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:49.998
Tom thought and thought.

13
00:00:49.999 --> 00:00:55.295
He checked his spell books.

14
00:00:55.296 --> 00:00:59.437
Finally Tom went to the royal stables.

15
00:00:59.438 --> 00:01:01.667
He lifted his wand.

16
00:01:01.668 --> 00:01:03.844
"Horses, run fast!

17
00:01:03.845 --> 00:01:07.036
Carriage, do not be last!"

18
00:01:07.037 --> 00:01:11.700
Poof! Wings appeared on the carriage wheels.

19
00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:14.651
The horses sparkled with magic.

20
00:01:14.652 --> 00:01:21.399
Tom smiled. "I hope this works!"

21
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:28.532
Soon the other kings and wizards arrived.

22
00:01:28.533 --> 00:01:32.284
One wizard waved at Tom.

23
00:01:32.285 --> 00:01:33.821
It was May.

24
00:01:33.822 --> 00:01:36.873
Tom knew her from wizard school.

25
00:01:36.874 --> 00:01:40.542
Another wizard was laughing.

26
00:01:40.543 --> 00:01:42.665
It was Walter.

27
00:01:42.666 --> 00:01:46.672
"I know which king will lose this race!" Walter said.

28
00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:50.325
"Tom can't even put a spell on an apple cart.

29
00:01:50.326 --> 00:01:54.269
His carriage will be as slow as a snail!"

30
00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.000
Tom frowned.

31
00:01:56.001 --> 00:01:58.243
"Just wait, Walter!" he said.

32
00:01:58.244 --> 00:02:00.533
"My king will win!"

33
00:02:00.534 --> 00:02:11.094
"Ha-ha!" said Walter. "We'll see about that!"

